{
  "bookId": "hero-213201",
  "id": "bond-28532",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28532001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "这是什么，一座狗屋？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28532003",
              "text": "……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28532002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28532003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "虽然有些简陋，但「王子」收到的话，应该也会高兴吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28532005",
              "text": "……「王子」？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28532004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28532005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "「王子」是一只西伯利亚哈士奇犬，我十岁时捡到的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28532006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这样阿……卡缪一定很想念它吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28532007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "一条狗罢了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28532009",
              "text": "……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28532008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28532009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "怎么，没有话要对我说吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28532011",
              "text": "一时间不知道该说什么。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28532011",
              "text": "今天太阳很好。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28532010",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28532011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "既然这样，要不要加入我的亲卫队？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28532012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "虽然是个听起来有点蠢的东西，但你在的话，我会破格关注一些。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28532013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "神，不爱他的子民，\n但会眷顾他的亲卫队。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28532015",
              "text": "这算是感激吗？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28532015",
              "text": "这是邀请吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28532014",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28532015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "text": "不，这是恩赐。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "28532",
